+// ═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
+// LAYER 3 — the erased-owner path: zero replicas, a known erasure request
+// id, the receipt and NOTHING else.
+// ═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
+console.log("\n── layer 3: an owner with nothing left gets the receipt and nothing else ──");
